WEBVTT

00:16:28.755 --> 00:16:30.255
Treća stvar, verovatno,

00:16:30.255 --> 00:16:33.543
mi zaista možemo da budemo srećni
jer živimo u demokratiji,

00:16:33.543 --> 00:16:37.223
jer budite sigurni da Rusija i Kina

00:16:37.223 --> 00:16:38.755
rade isto to,

00:16:38.755 --> 00:16:40.321
ali niko ne govori o tome

00:16:40.321 --> 00:16:42.612
jer niko ne sme to da radi.

00:16:42.612 --> 00:16:47.576
(Aplauz)

00:16:49.398 --> 00:16:51.451
BĐ: Kada je priča prvi put objavljena,

00:16:51.451 --> 00:16:53.646
prošlog jula prošle godine,

00:16:53.646 --> 00:16:56.474
podneli ste krivičnu prijavu

00:16:56.474 --> 00:16:59.454
Nemačkom sudu. Zašto?

00:16:59.454 --> 00:17:02.667
HK: Da, uradio sam to zbog druge stvari
koju sam pomenuo,